  "paragraph": 9,
  "text": "During decode, you only have one new token vector. Yet to produce that single output token, the GPU must still stream the entire model's weights, often over a hundred gigabytes, from HBM into SRAM, run one tiny vector multiply, discard the weights, and repeat for the next word. It is like driving an eighteen-wheeler across town to deliver a single postcard.",
